<title>UK: Reckitt yr pretax rises 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Reckitt yr pretax rises 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		50.8		 vs 44.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.41		 vs 12.80</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 21.97		vs 20.15</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    316.5		vs 285.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,294.7	    vs 2,253.3</p>
<p>Operating profit from</p>
<p>  continuing operations 370.6		vs 340.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 314 and 320 million stg. Earnings per share is on an adjusted, fully-diluted basis. Full name of the British household, toiletry and pharmaceutical products maker is Reckitt and Colman Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
